{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not ready.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It Takes a Demo to prepare, to understand, and to acquire the relevant skills and knowledge to survive the battlefield. With director's narration offering deep insights into the game and its foundational themes, this five minute experience is the perfect prelude to <strong>It Takes a War. </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Takes a War: Demo Drills: Director's Cut</strong> is a short 3-5 minute experience that is unique unto itself. This has not been taken from the main game, and is in fact a self-contained prelude to what's to come in the full game...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048280/extras/88599249d327a8a3ba972fd2d2d4f66d.avif?t=1760028858\" width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <i>THE CORRIDOR</i> comes<strong> It Takes a War</strong>\u00a0- a team-based shooter with <strong>VISCERAL</strong> gunplay and <strong>RELENTLESS</strong> action. Throw yourself into <strong>RELENTLESSLY VISCERAL</strong> combat where survival is entirely dependent on communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'i' in 'team', but there is in <strong>VICTORY</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048280?t=1760028858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048280/861da3c14e7bfba97ab425bdadf4d68f30a056a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760028858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048280/3d61bc1f4ee5e8f06817173cd19695e71130b818/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760028858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048280/